      "UTC time | Source | Event | Account/Host | Confidence\n10:02:11 | Auth | Failed login x6 | svc-batch / host-a | high\n10:02:47 | Auth | Success login | svc-batch / host-a | high\n10:03:05 | Endpoint | 4688 cmd.exe spawned by svc-batch | host-a | medium\n10:05:30 | Firewall | outbound 4444 blocked | host-a | low"
